{"id":"66d6a38c-601e-445e-b1fa-7a833936508c","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:21:04.452Z","batchId":"pricing_gpt-6-luna_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <p class=\"small muted\">PLANS &amp; PRICING</p>\n    <h1>Simple plans that grow with you</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Choose the plan that fits your workflow. Upgrade or downgrade whenever you need.</p>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">All plans are billed monthly.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Available plans\">\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Free</h2>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Get started</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">The essentials for trying things out or working solo.</p>\n      <p class=\"stat-value\">$0 <span class=\"small muted\">/ month</span></p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"/signup?plan=free\">Start for free</a>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Includes</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>1 user</li>\n        <li>3 active projects</li>\n        <li>Basic reporting</li>\n        <li>Community support</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"border: 2px solid var(--primary, #6366f1);\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Pro</h2>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">More room and powerful tools for getting work done.</p>\n      <p class=\"stat-value\">$18 <span class=\"small muted\">/ month</span></p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"/signup?plan=pro\">Choose Pro</a>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Free, plus</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n        <li>Advanced reporting</li>\n        <li>Automations and integrations</li>\n        <li>Priority email support</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Team</h2>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">For collaboration</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Shared tools and visibility for teams working together.</p>\n      <p class=\"stat-value\">$49 <span class=\"small muted\">/ month</span></p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"/signup?plan=team\">Choose Team</a>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Pro, plus</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Up to 10 team members</li>\n        <li>Shared team workspace</li>\n        <li>Roles and permissions</li>\n        <li>Centralized team billing</li>\n        <li>Priority support</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Questions about which plan is right for you? <a href=\"mailto:support@example.com\">Contact our team</a>.</p>\n</main>","deltas":[[7943,"<"],[7945,"main"],[7950," class"],[7955,"=\""],[7960,"page"],[7965," stack"],[7970," gap"],[7975,"-lg"],[7980,"\">\n"],[7984," "],[7995," <"],[7995,"header"],[7995," class"],[8001,"=\""],[8007,"stack"],[8012," gap"],[8021,"-sm"],[8023,"\">\n"],[8025,"   "],[8029," <"],[8031,"p"],[8036," class"],[8041,"=\""],[8044,"small"],